<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 11.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   93/94    100/101    UNQ    172/175</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  95/97    101/103  188/190  196/198</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes were stable to slightly softer on Wednesday amid poor demand and the weak cargo market, traders said. One supplier said he fixed a 380-cst grade parcel at $96 per tonne with his routine customer, but noted that some shipowners asked for as low as $93.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
